  "observed_reading": {
    "model": "gemma-4-31b-it via adaptionlabs, one pass per asset, 22 nov 2026",
    "hair": "long brown, centre or side parting, worn down in every frame: no up-do anywhere in the set, so an up-do is a styling decision and not something the references show",
    "wardrobe": "one silhouette repeated with one variable: a black satin slip alone in nine frames, the same slip under a burgundy oversized leather jacket in eight, a black lace camisole with black denim at the platform",
    "places": "car interior at night, a studio backdrop, and a metro platform; nothing in the set is a room with a window and a desk, which retires the studygram desk i invented before the board existed",
    "treatment": "the nine frame carousel is the same shoot in black and white, so a treatment is not a second look",
    "what_it_does_not_show": "no footwear in any frame, no bag, no jewellery that survived as a fixed item, and no daylight interior. those are gaps to fill deliberately rather than invent quietly"
  }
}